


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_bb0e4071:



    voice "2SA_0238"
    sachiko "「等下。我现在去准备下工具」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_f69bdae9:


    "宿管房里传来祥子的声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_4cec6d9b:



    voice "2MI_0388"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_69ad914c:


    "圣夜子正在走廊上等着。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_e1541833:


    "因为早上说好的来帮忙扫雪，与采购的三人道别之后，只有她先回来了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_8a145185:



    voice "2SA_0239"
    sachiko "「雪已经停了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_68cec110:



    voice "2MI_0389"
    miyako "「是的，我们回来的时候已经停了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_b259614c:



    voice "2SA_0240"
    sachiko "「那就不用穿雨衣了吧。剩下的就是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_8e71b6b4:



    voice "2MI_0390"
    miyako "「这一带之后会积更厚的雪吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_278c7e29:


    "……………………"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_564508b6:



    voice "2MI_0391"
    miyako "「……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_958e35a9:


    "圣夜子正要把手放到门把手上的时候门开了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_b66f6a1f:



    voice "2SA_0241"
    sachiko "「噢，久等了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_5c187edc:



    voice "2MI_0392"
    miyako "「嗯、好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_91b548e6:


    "突然的相见让二人有些迷茫。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_28b18c21:



    voice "2SA_0242"
    sachiko "「抱歉，让你久等了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_85d942cd:



    voice "2MI_0393"
    miyako "「没事。只准备了这些工具吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_7b1ce83b:


    "祥子的手上拿着铁锹和装有手套的一个小铁桶。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_da551be1:



    voice "2SA_0243"
    sachiko "「嗯，大家伙我已经拿到屋顶上了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_03ec2d70:



    voice "2MI_0394"
    miyako "「原来如此……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_c0b0bddd:


    "祥子慢悠悠地将围巾围到圣夜子的脖子上。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_ea0420a4:



    voice "2MI_0395"
    miyako "「这个是……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_16bd92a6:



    voice "2SA_0244"
    sachiko "「围巾。毕竟很冷」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_83c93202:



    voice "2MI_0396"
    miyako "「可以借给我用吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_ba2f9089:



    voice "2SA_0245"
    sachiko "「嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_eb2125b6:



    voice "2MI_1294a"
    miyako "「……烟味」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_a81b96c4:


    "圣夜子注意到了围在脖子上的围巾上残留的气味。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_3adb5764:



    voice "2SA_0246"
    sachiko "「怎么了？不舒服？还是不喜欢造型？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_159d94ba:



    voice "2MI_0397"
    miyako "「不是。我从来没看到过你围围巾」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_d4f97e33:



    voice "2SA_0247"
    sachiko "「嗯。嘛，毕竟一直都被我放起来了……但是，我觉得会很适合你」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_836051ea:



    voice "2MI_0398"
    miyako "「是吗，谢谢你！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_7468e787:



    voice "2SA_0248"
    sachiko "「嗯，那我们走吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_10_87c4ba98:



    voice "2MI_0399"
    miyako "「是的！」"
